<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about your experience in {!Case.Departure_Airport__c} on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I was very concerned to learn that you were moved to a different cabin on our QF{!Case.Flight_Number__c} flight. I do understand how disappointing this would have been for you and would like to apologise for the inconvenience caused, on behalf of Qantas.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If overbooking add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Airlines sometimes overbook flights to offset the high number of late cancellations and customers who ‘no show’. This common system allows airlines to provide seats to as many people as possible and keep fares lower than they would be otherwise. While customers’ travel needs are carefully taken into consideration, our estimates can occasionally be incorrect and we do not have enough cancellations as departure date approaches. In these cases, we can move customers to alternative flights to get them to their destination, offer a refund of the difference in fare if they are moved to a lower cabin, or offer a full refund if they decide the no longer wish to travel.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If aircraft downgrade add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Regrettably, your original aircraft developed a mechanical problem and it was necessary to change planes to get you on your way without significant further delay. Configurations can vary from service to service and the only alternative aircraft available had less seats in the <b><i>-First/Business/Premium Economy-</i></b> Class cabin. I am sorry this meant you needed to be moved to <b><i>-Business/Premium Economy/Economy-</i></b> Class.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have arranged a refund of the difference in fare between your original ticket purchased and the class flown. A credit of {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c} will be made to the original form of payment and this should reflect in your account balance in approximately 7 business days.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If downgrade comp provided add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I believe our airport staff have already arranged {!Case.Recovery_Quantity__c} downgrade compensation for you as a gesture of goodwill. This comes with our further apologies for letting you down.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If EMD issued by airport needs to be refunded:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I can see that our airport staff have arranged a $<b><i>-AMOUNT-</i></b> voucher as downgrade compensation. We would be happy to process the payment for you and I have attached a form for you to provide your bank account details. When returning the completed form, please reply to this email to ensure the information is attached to your file and promptly actioned.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Your comments about the way this was handled, have been forwarded to our Airport Management for reviews of our downgrade handling procedures, so we appreciate you providing your first-hand experience. I hope we have the opportunity to welcome you aboard Qantas again soon.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>